# French (France) translation for compas-player.
#
# MACHINE DRAFT: pending native review. Tone: "vous" register, short and
# plain wording as in French device UIs.
#
# Glossary (keep consistent; extend when adding strings):
#   Queue = File d'attente (short: file)   Up Next = A suivre / Lire ensuite
#   Playlist = Playlist                    Library = Bibliotheque
#   Settings = Parametres                  Favorites = Favoris
#   Most Played = Les plus ecoutes         Shuffle = Aleatoire
#   Repeat = Repeter                       Gapless = Gapless (English)
#   Crossfade = Crossfade (English)        Equalizer = Egaliseur (EQ)
#   Plugin = Plugin (Plugin Store = Boutique de plugins)
#   Cover / album art = Pochette           Metadata = Metadonnees
#   SD card = Carte SD                     Firmware Update = Mise a jour du firmware
#   On / Off = Active / Desactive          Now Playing = Lecture en cours
#   Lyrics = Paroles                       Books = Livres
#   Stream Media = Streaming               Home = Accueil
#   Refresh = Actualiser                   Update = Mettre a jour
#   Kept in English as product or technical names: Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, AirPlay,
#   DLNA, Subsonic, ReplayGain, DAC, USB, ADB, LDAC, aptX, AAC, SBC, PEQ, PIN,
#   Compas Player, Compas Remote Control, Weekly Beta, RC. Time zone city
#   names, release labels and codec names are not translated.
# Before ? ! : ; a regular no-break space (U+00A0) is used.
# (Accents are used in the actual msgstr values below; this comment block is
#  ASCII only.)
#
